  "interpretation_limits": [
    "USB_PD type and usb_power_delivery operation-mode labels are not proof of an active PD contract: real_type is USB_HVDCP_3 and pd_active is 0.",
    "pd_current_max=-22 is an invalid/error-like raw value, not physical negative current; confirm the matched stock getter.",
    "Charging and positive battery current are one stock-driver observation, not a complete current-sign calibration.",
    "charge_counter=90 is not assumed to be a validated standard charge value.",
    "No charger efficiency, battery health, or before/after energy conclusion is derived.",
    "CPU policy limits are not hardware maximum frequencies; limiting owner is unobserved.",
    "Suspend counters are lifetime history, not a controlled suspend trial.",
    "runtime_status=unsupported does not establish that the hardware remains powered.",
    "wakeup_count is intentionally excluded because a normal read may block.",
    "The idle-inclusive trace has ring-buffer losses and cannot support a complete event sequence or residency calculation.",
    "The lower-volume trace excludes cpu_idle; its empty idle map does not imply no idle transitions.",
    "Later frequency events exceed earlier static policy caps; those caps must not be extrapolated across observation windows.",
    "KGSL state counts do not measure state residency or energy savings.",
    "No observed suspend or DRM-vblank records in a short uncontrolled sample do not prove lack of support or zero screen updates."
  ],
